#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0218 expect=noViolation domain=SV
#runLevel Info
#note "SV Assumption 11 (SDTMIG 3.2/3.3; #15 in 3.4): SV.EPOCH is the epoch of the element in progress when the visit starts; SE Assumption 10: an element's SEENDTC is the next element's SESTDTC, the transition instant belongs to the next element (end-exclusive). PLAN-cg0218-transition-day-precision (B2, owner 2026-10-05): a visit is judged against every element that MAY be in progress at its start and reported only when its EPOCH matches none of them, once, on the element that contains it (ERROR); partial dates on the same principle at INFO (Q4), once per candidate element. Movement (Q5, mixed precision): the visit is date-only (2012-07-09) while SE carries times (SCREENING ends 2012-07-09T10:00, TREATMENT starts then). Compared at the day the two are equal, so SCREENING ending on the visit day with an untimed visit MAY still be in progress and is a candidate; the visit's EPOCH SCREENING matches it, so nothing fires at ERROR or INFO. Today the exclusion required SVSTDTC == SE.SESTDTC as text, which a timed SESTDTC never satisfies, and convention A reported SCREENING against TREATMENT: RED against the old rule."
dataset SV label="Subject Visits"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col VISITNUM type=Num label="Visit Number"
col VISIT type=Char label="Visit Name"
col SVSTDTC type=Char label="Start Date/Time of Visit"
col EPOCH type=Char label="Epoch"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | SV | 01-701-0001 | 2 | DAY 1 | 2012-07-09 | SCREENING
---

dataset SE label="Subject Elements"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col SESEQ type=Num label="Sequence Number"
col SESTDTC type=Char label="Start Date/Time of Element"
col SEENDTC type=Char label="End Date/Time of Element"
col EPOCH type=Char label="Epoch"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | SE | 01-701-0001 | 1 | 2012-07-06T09:00 | 2012-07-09T10:00 | SCREENING
CDISCPILOT01 | SE | 01-701-0001 | 2 | 2012-07-09T10:00 | 2012-08-20T12:00 | TREATMENT
---
